# Logi Options+ settings that macconfig-check.sh verifies (read-only) for the MX Master 3S.
# Read by lib/logi-settings.py from a temporary copy of
# ~/Library/Application Support/LogiOptionsPlus/settings.db; nothing is ever written
# back (restore is by hand in the app, or from Logi's cloud backup).
# Cloud backup itself is NOT checked: the "Automatically backup all devices" toggle and
# the last-backup time aren't stored in any readable local file (the per-device
# settings_backup_state_v2.knownDevices flags stay false with backup on), so manual
# step logi-cloud-backup is by hand.
#
# The device is found by model id, never by serial number:
#   model | <deviceModel> | <display name>
#
# Checks (pipe-delimited):
#   id | scope | where | path | type | expected | tolerance | severity | label
#   scope:     slot   = an assignment of the default profile whose slotId is
#                       <device slotPrefix>_<where>; path is relative to that assignment
#              global = a top-level settings key; where is unused; {model} in path is
#                       replaced by the model id
#   type:      str | bool | num (num: |actual - expected| <= tolerance)
#   severity:  drift = a setting that changed (reported as DRIFT)
#              warn  = not set up yet (reported as a warning)
# Paths are dot-separated keys. Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored.

model|2b034|MX Master 3S

wheel-natural|slot|mouse_scroll_wheel_settings|card.mouseScrollWheelSettings.dir|str|NATURAL||drift|Main wheel: scroll direction Natural
wheel-smooth|slot|mouse_scroll_wheel_settings|card.mouseScrollWheelSettings.isSmooth|bool|true||drift|Main wheel: Smooth scrolling On
smartshift|slot|mouse_scroll_wheel_settings|card.mouseScrollWheelSettings.smartshift.isEnabled|bool|true||drift|Main wheel: SmartShift On
thumb-horizontal|slot|thumb_wheel_adapter|card.name|str|ASSIGNMENT_NAME_HORIZONTAL_SCROLL||drift|Thumb wheel: Horizontal scroll
thumb-smooth|slot|mouse_thumb_wheel_settings|card.mouseThumbWheelSettings.isSmooth|bool|true||drift|Thumb wheel: Smooth scrolling On
gesture-window-nav|slot|c195|card.selectedNestedCard|str|window_navigation||drift|Gesture button: Window navigation
pointer-speed|slot|mouse_settings|card.mouseSettings.pointerSpeed.active.value|num|0.12|0.02|drift|Pointer speed 0.12
